    "summary": "PT Hartadinata Abadi Tbk manufactures and sells gold jewelry in Indonesia. The company offers necklaces, rings, pendants, earrings, and bracelets. It is also involved in e-commerce and pawnshop activities. The company operates a retail chain of stores under the Aurum Collection Center, ACC Premium, Claudia Perfect Jewellery, Celine Jewellery, and Hartadinata Abadi Store names. It distributes its products through wholesalers, retail stores, independent stores, and franchise stores, as well as through online. The company was founded in 1989 and is based in Bandung, Indonesia. PT Hartadinata Abadi Tbk operates as a subsidiary of PT Terang Anugrah Abadi."
